  /api/inventory/flow-pending/{scan_id}/replacement-issue:
    post:
      operationId: inventory_flow_pending_replacement_issue_create
      description: |-
        Tạo Phiếu Xuất kho hàng gửi bù cho một mã ĐÃ khớp từ trước (ca lịch sử).

        Hành động thực sự là xuất kho nên soi section "shipments" như luồng quét chuẩn,
        dù danh sách đọc được qua "stock".
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: scan_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - inventory
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/FlowReplacementIssueRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/FlowReplacementIssueRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/FlowReplacementIssueRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/FlowReplacementIssueResult'
          description: ''
  /api/inventory/flow-pending/{scan_id}/unmatch:
    post:
      operationId: inventory_flow_pending_unmatch_create
      description: |-
        Gỡ khớp mã XUẤT đã khớp nhầm đơn (hoàn tồn + trả đơn về Kho đang xử lý).

        Hành động thực sự đảo bút toán xuất kho nên soi section "shipments" như luồng
        quét chuẩn, dù danh sách đọc được qua "stock".
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: scan_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - inventory
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/FlowPendingUnmatchResult'
          description: ''
  /api/inventory/import/parse-lines:
    post:
      operationId: inventory_import_parse_lines_create
      description: |-
        Parse an uploaded .xlsx file and resolve SKUs to product lines.

        Multipart body: ``file`` — the .xlsx workbook.

        Returns:
            200 ``{"lines": [...], "errors": [...]}``
            400 if file missing or unreadable.
      tags:
      - inventory
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParseImportLinesRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParseImportLinesRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
