        * `kol` - KOL
        * `zalo` - Zalo
        * `messenger` - Messenger
        * `hotline` - Hotline
        * `koc` - KOC
        * `shopee` - Shopee
        * `tiktok` - TikTok
        * `foxia` - Foxia
        * `cnv` - CNV Loyalty
